OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FJim responds to an urgent call for
OL,7,     Fbackup from a colleague, who is
OL,8,     Fsurrounded by an angry mob
OL,9,     Ffollowing a report of an agressive
OL,10,     Fyoung man's dangerous driving.
OL,11,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,12,     FTeaming up with neighbouring
OL,13,     Fforces under Operation Fuego
OL,14,     FDerbyshire's police chase a
OL,15,     Fgetaway driver on a 120mph
OL,16,     Frampage.
OL,17,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FA serial offender gives the
OL,19,     FCumbrian officers the runaround
OL,20,     Fand a high-speed pursuit comes to
OL,21,     Fa painful finish.
