OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe interceptors smash down a door
OL,7,     Fto save a man's life, and a
OL,8,     Ffleeing Land Rover rams two cop
OL,9,     Fcars in a bid to get away.
OL,10,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FThe Cumbrian interceptors tackle a
OL,12,     Fwoman trapped inside a burning
OL,13,     Fcar, a bad boy racer, a bullock
OL,14,     Fbreakout and drink-related
OL,15,     Fincidents on Black Eye Friday.
OL,16,G1700 Car Pound Cops
OL,17,     FWith exclusive access to car
OL,18,     Fpounds, police forces, local
OL,19,     Fcouncil enforcement agencies and
OL,20,     Fnational organisations, we track
