OL,5,G2200 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FThe work of a major hospital
OL,7,     Ftrauma unit. Ian is rushed in
OL,8,     Fafter suffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,9,     FKen is flown to the hospital by
OL,10,     Fhelicopter after falling from a
OL,11,     Froof onto a skip.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Dev removes the clinic's
OL,14,     Fheaviest lipoma yet. Dr Natalia
OL,15,     Finvestigates an unsual rash, while
OL,16,     FDr Adil, Dr Emma, and Dr Magnus
OL,17,     Fface cysts and a
OL,18,     Fcareer-threatening lump.
