OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FAfter having fallen down the
OL,7,     Fstairs the night before,
OL,8,     F44-year-old Gavin woke up with a
OL,9,     Fsore neck. He walked himself into
OL,10,     FA&E.
OL,11,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FDr Emma helps a village hall
OL,13,     Fmanager to look lump-free ready
OL,14,     Ffor her 40th birthday party. Dr
OL,15,     FNatalia digs out a cyst to give
OL,16,     Fher patient a smooth back for a
OL,17,     Fholiday to Egypt.
